{"_type":"issue","id":"SlackBackup-06o","title":"Python rewrite: workspace/channel/catalog commands","description":"Port register-workspace.sh, register-channel.sh, validate-channels.sh, channel_catalog.sh, and catalog-channels.sh into the slackbackup CLI. New modules: slackdump.py (subprocess wrapper around the slackdump binary - workspace select/list/import, list channels JSON, search files/messages, archive/resume), catalog_logic.py (per-workspace catalog cache: fast/full tier merge rules, -no-chan-cache fix preserved, description via topic/purpose), channel_logic.py (channels.json validate/register/list, catalog-backed name lookup with full-tier fallback), workspace_logic.py (tokens file lookup, workspace import, status listing). Wire into workspace.py/channel.py/catalog.py CLI handlers. Must preserve all bug fixes already found in the bash version: -no-chan-cache (stale cross-workspace cache bug), full-tier-never-overwrites-member=yes, description-no-extra-API-call.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","assignee":"Stuart Donaldson","owner":"stuart.donaldson@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-06-23T19:37:58Z","created_by":"Stuart Donaldson","updated_at":"2026-06-23T19:44:31Z","started_at":"2026-06-23T19:38:05Z","closed_at":"2026-06-23T19:44:31Z","close_reason":"Implemented and verified live: slackdump.py (subprocess wrapper, preserves -no-chan-cache fix and -no-json), catalog_logic.py (JSON-native cache replacing the bash TSV+marker-files approach, same fast/full merge rules), channel_logic.py, workspace_logic.py. Wired into workspace.py/channel.py/catalog.py CLI handlers (workspace register/list, channel register/list/validate, catalog show). 50 passing tests (36 new in this stage). Verified live: catalog show output matches the bash version exactly for f3pugetsound; channel register works end-to-end (lookup -\u003e append -\u003e idempotent re-run); workspace list matches register-workspace.sh's status output.","dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":